        <mxCell id="bf06-branches" value="&lt;b&gt;Alternates/exceptions — see matching Section 4 branches and UC contracts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;BF-06-E1: Unverified external order, duplicate SO/WIR copy, missing SO link or stock race&lt;br&gt;BF-06-A1: Partial, delayed or substituted fulfilment across releases&lt;br&gt;BF-06-E2: Picking discrepancy&lt;br&gt;BF-06-A2: Cancelled or delayed handover before PGI&lt;br&gt;BF-06-E3: After PGI: missing photo, partial/refused delivery or return&lt;br&gt;BF-06-A3: External payment pending, partial, unclear or known early before DELIVERED&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;EX-01–05: role/warehouse, source/version, unknown commit/retry, freeze, evidence/output. Reject/wait/revise preserves the relevant case; never repost automatically.&lt;br&gt;WIR may complete on issue; SO still waits for POD then PAY-CFM. Carrier handover ≠ customer receipt. Fully cancelled before delivery → CANCELLED; confirmation/correction changes no stock." vertex="1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#24354b;rounded=1;fillColor=#f3f5f8;strokeColor=#d6dde6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;">
